rider level: Intermediate
shape: Tapered Directional/Directional (tail narrower than nose, enhanced control and stability in deeper snow, improved floatation in powder, smoother turns, ideal for freeride and backcountry)
flex pattern: Directional Flex (increases pop in tail, stiffer nose for easier control in all conditions)
camber type: Directional Camber (rocker in nose for extra float in powder, retaining response and stability of traditional camber for power, response, and edge control)
width options: Standard, Wide
mounting system: The Channel (fine-tune stance width, more freedom in stance location, compatible with most major binding brands, works best with Burton EST bindings)
available lengths: 142cm, 146cm, 150cm, 154cm, 158cm, 162cm, 158cm Wide, 162cm Wide
laminate: 45° Carbon Highlights (tip to tail carbon layer reduces weight, 45° angled fibres fine-tune torsional flex for more aggressive ride)
core: Super Fly II 700G Core with Dualzone EGD and Squeezebox (stronger and lighter woods targeted in specific areas, more pop and strength while reducing weight)
core zones: Dualzone EGD (wood grain aligned along heel and toe edge in two unbroken zones perpendicular to rest of core for consistent edge hold and strength)
core sections: Squeezebox (thicker powerful sections combined with thinner flexible sections profiled throughout core, enhances energy transfer, snappier and more stable)
edges: Frostbite Edges (edges extend out slightly underneath bindings for enhanced edge hold on hardpack and ice)
base: Sintered WFO (Wide F!#@ing Open - extra absorbent high density sintered material infused with specially formulated wax, ultra durable)
durability technology: Infinite Ride (overbuilt in factory then broken down by machinery so board rides the same from day one to day 100)
tip and tail: Pro-Tip (tip and tail taper out at points, reducing swing weight and promoting mobility)
resin: Super Sap Epoxy (bio-based resin, reduces carbon footprint by 50% over petroleum-based epoxies)
shipping restriction: Only available for shipping within Australia
